#: scenario8:scenario8_3415F546_2206_41FD_913E_036A55A19598
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7cfd906fb8ed04fac606ab26e138026b5a4b50a7a1189a532f2b3fdadbf0e1f7
#. default-sha256: cb12917fec0482ea59953b4b851b818560e549ddc7d27a0037e86f6e0d4a2540
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3415F546_2206_41FD_913E_036A55A19598"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But all my questions, my confusion, my frustration—⟪k:1⟫everything that composes my "
"“present”—⟪k:2⟫is superseded by that darkness...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫...wisping away into nothing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫But all my questions, my confusion, my frustration—⟪k:1⟫everything that composes my "
"“present”—⟪k:2⟫is superseded by that darkness...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫...wisping away into nothing."

#: scenario8:scenario8_95E8F20B_9A0E_4DF1_AA86_833544152729
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6df75b2f7655d04dc992d0385bdd2973cc6bbdc21e700a441da21f481ea1032
#. default-sha256: a61e4afb6ff55103b379f18842bba5bad11515e7c5afd7b6f888a649395e6978
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_95E8F20B_9A0E_4DF1_AA86_833544152729"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I never “yearned” for the world outside what I knew. ⟪k:1⟫I more “coveted” it—a splash of "
"spite mixed in. ⟪k:2⟫I wanted to claw my way up the mountain, knock all the bastards down who had "
"never seen what it was like at the bottom.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫If I made it high enough, I could do "
"anything. ⟪k:6⟫I would have complete freedom.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫If that sounds like a childish "
"fantasy to you, well, you’d be right. That’s exactly what it was."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫I never “yearned” for the world outside what I knew. ⟪k:1⟫I more “coveted” it—a splash of "
"spite mixed in. ⟪k:2⟫I wanted to claw my way up the mountain, knock all the bastards down who had "
"never seen what it was like at the bottom.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫If I made it high enough, I could do "
"anything. ⟪k:6⟫I would have complete freedom.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫If that sounds like a childish "
"fantasy to you, well, you’d be right. That’s exactly what it was."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3A6D383F_D886_440A_97F6_7CC9B5C6389A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d483bfa43e34927cb202a5439bdb7284273c6b3730f08f7cafd1820f86064bb
#. default-sha256: 5970e840ae9354ad4f1c1c6622f58a40f6466d85e046cefa9cb0842bef530fbe
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3A6D383F_D886_440A_97F6_7CC9B5C6389A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“There you are. ⟪k:1⟫You spend so much time in the graveyard that,⟪k:2⟫one of these days, "
"someone’s going to think you’re a gravekeeper—⟪k:3⟫or maybe a graverobber.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“I can "
"understand a grave⟪k:7⟫keeper⟪k:8⟫, but I take offense at the suggestion I look like a grave⟪k:9⟫"
"robber⟪k:10⟫. ⟪k:11⟫I’m praying for the souls who have no one to see them off.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫The girl—named Morgana—turned around to face me. ⟪k:16⟫Though I’d known her for some time, "
"I’d rarely ever looked her in the eyes. ⟪k:17⟫Her face was almost always concealed beneath a dark "
"hood, revealing only the tip of her nose and sometimes her lips."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“There you are. ⟪k:1⟫You spend so much time in the graveyard that,⟪k:2⟫one of these days, "
"someone’s going to think you’re a gravekeeper—⟪k:3⟫or maybe a graverobber.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“I can "
"understand a grave⟪k:7⟫keeper⟪k:8⟫, but I take offense at the suggestion I look like a grave⟪k:9⟫"
"robber⟪k:10⟫. ⟪k:11⟫I’m praying for the souls who have no one to see them off.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫The girl—named Morgana—turned around to face me. ⟪k:16⟫Though I’d known her for some time, "
"I’d rarely ever looked her in the eyes. ⟪k:17⟫Her face was almost always concealed beneath a dark "
"hood, revealing only the tip of her nose and sometimes her lips."

#: scenario8:scenario8_67C1772B_FF27_45C8_8ED4_4E60EADBB8D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 320b872b6b01ca5051f8969f0b2232ef1f17e15f217c267b985541af6b7f2878
#. default-sha256: ee497ac31a732d7656f48b4f7b75c53fdc8146075928caf8149a6f5a9663c161
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_67C1772B_FF27_45C8_8ED4_4E60EADBB8D8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Honestly, I don’t get it. Why do you care so much?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“These are souls that "
"have no one else to pray for them. ⟪k:4⟫At best,⟪k:5⟫they may get a bit of lip service from a "
"priest once or twice. ⟪k:6⟫It’s our responsibility to offer a helping hand to the sick and the "
"poor, ⟪k:7⟫to pray for the abandoned souls.”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫“What I don’t get is why you need to "
"pray for the dead at all. ⟪k:11⟫They’re just bags of bones.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“I hope you enjoy "
"an eternity in Hell, blasphemer.”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“Hey! ⟪k:18⟫That was uncalled for!”⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫"
"⟪k:21⟫“I’m just joking, obviously.”⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫“You take black humor to a new level!”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Honestly, I don’t get it. Why do you care so much?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“These are souls that "
"have no one else to pray for them. ⟪k:4⟫At best,⟪k:5⟫they may get a bit of lip service from a "
"priest once or twice. ⟪k:6⟫It’s our responsibility to offer a helping hand to the sick and the "
"poor, ⟪k:7⟫to pray for the abandoned souls.”⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫“What I don’t get is why you need to "
"pray for the dead at all. ⟪k:11⟫They’re just bags of bones.”⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫“I hope you enjoy "
"an eternity in Hell, blasphemer.”⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫“Hey! ⟪k:18⟫That was uncalled for!”⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫"
"⟪k:21⟫“I’m just joking, obviously.”⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫“You take black humor to a new level!”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_2CC37D5E_F21F_4BAE_B73F_9B2D6284E332
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: abfdea8afbef67fcf6fb845ab651e1ef33ce15293433878794828e014c7e5256
#. default-sha256: 11fafd82dfe65d9d8c99229154210561f729ca3dc9bbad86cd435d7f1d6e2f46
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2CC37D5E_F21F_4BAE_B73F_9B2D6284E332"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Morgana gave me a curt shrug, then turned away. ⟪k:1⟫She never faced anyone head-on for very "
"long, and she had a perfectly good reason for it. ⟪k:2⟫It wasn’t because she disliked me or "
"anything. ⟪k:3⟫...I don’t think, anyway.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫About three years earlier, something "
"had happened that had caused large patches of flesh to fall off her face. ⟪k:8⟫Supposedly, she "
"had looked fine before then, but I only knew her as she was at that time. ⟪k:9⟫The rest of her "
"body was covered in wounds as well, but applying ointment to them had reduced the scarring "
"significantly.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Her face, though, showed no signs of recovering."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Morgana gave me a curt shrug, then turned away. ⟪k:1⟫She never faced anyone head-on for very "
"long, and she had a perfectly good reason for it. ⟪k:2⟫It wasn’t because she disliked me or "
"anything. ⟪k:3⟫...I don’t think, anyway.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫About three years earlier, something "
"had happened that had caused large patches of flesh to fall off her face. ⟪k:8⟫Supposedly, she "
"had looked fine before then, but I only knew her as she was at that time. ⟪k:9⟫The rest of her "
"body was covered in wounds as well, but applying ointment to them had reduced the scarring "
"significantly.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Her face, though, showed no signs of recovering."

#: scenario8:scenario8_AD23439B_53AA_4221_A353_48E40769E717
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 172b152a5b411722bb1bc3bfc596c50120e95ef8374477dc6d0d58e4bfdd75fc
#. default-sha256: c0ca51fe0be590d3a8ec734d556546ed0fa573e35e28a97c5b6acf6c6065d006
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_AD23439B_53AA_4221_A353_48E40769E717"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With a forlorn graveyard as their backdrop, a young man applied salve to a girl’s raw, "
"exposed flesh. ⟪k:1⟫It was quite possibly the least romantic sight in the world.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I "
"would have, at the very least, preferred a somewhat more pleasant location.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫As the "
"thought fluttered through my mind, I let out a defeated laugh, and I could soon feel her glaring "
"at me.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Morgana could be a bit standoffish, but honestly, I didn’t mind.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"For her, this was actually quite sociable, in fact. ⟪k:13⟫When I first met her,⟪k:14⟫she didn’t "
"act her age at all, but now, she was starting to show signs of the twelve-year-old girl hidden "
"inside."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫With a forlorn graveyard as their backdrop, a young man applied salve to a girl’s raw, "
"exposed flesh. ⟪k:1⟫It was quite possibly the least romantic sight in the world.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I "
"would have, at the very least, preferred a somewhat more pleasant location.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫As the "
"thought fluttered through my mind, I let out a defeated laugh, and I could soon feel her glaring "
"at me.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Morgana could be a bit standoffish, but honestly, I didn’t mind.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"For her, this was actually quite sociable, in fact. ⟪k:13⟫When I first met her,⟪k:14⟫she didn’t "
"act her age at all, but now, she was starting to show signs of the twelve-year-old girl hidden "
"inside."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F1A96C76_9177_4550_97E0_AE448E6B9E47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8ecffe03b17ae34a303c19246f9247495bf0cec0ab9c30cba30d1d191f977e2
#. default-sha256: 8860b631272c0035320c91b12103f0da652d4da39736f12f30b9ea5a1f0e2f46
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F1A96C76_9177_4550_97E0_AE448E6B9E47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Three years prior, when I met Morgana, she had been the victim of unspeakable abuse at the "
"hands of the lord. ⟪k:1⟫I didn’t know why he had done those things to her, ⟪k:2⟫and I didn’t ask "
"either—because I knew doing so would only reopen old wounds. ⟪k:3⟫All I knew was that the lord "
"was so far gone as a human being as to brutally torture a nine-year-old girl.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫At "
"the time, the only thing that ever seemed to come out of her mouth was the word of God. ⟪k:7⟫"
"Everything she said or did was ostensibly for the benefit of others, ⟪k:8⟫but it felt to me more "
"like she was acting out of some sort of sense of duty rather than genuine concern. ⟪k:9⟫"
"Honorable, but ultimately hollow.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫I much, much preferred this Morgana, "
"⟪k:14⟫even if she could be a bit... jaded."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Three years prior, when I met Morgana, she had been the victim of unspeakable abuse at the "
"hands of the lord. ⟪k:1⟫I didn’t know why he had done those things to her, ⟪k:2⟫and I didn’t ask "
"either—because I knew doing so would only reopen old wounds. ⟪k:3⟫All I knew was that the lord "
"was so far gone as a human being as to brutally torture a nine-year-old girl.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫At "
"the time, the only thing that ever seemed to come out of her mouth was the word of God. ⟪k:7⟫"
"Everything she said or did was ostensibly for the benefit of others, ⟪k:8⟫but it felt to me more "
"like she was acting out of some sort of sense of duty rather than genuine concern. ⟪k:9⟫"
"Honorable, but ultimately hollow.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫I much, much preferred this Morgana, "
"⟪k:14⟫even if she could be a bit... jaded."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EEC57AB7_24CC_4487_88E7_654011AAFDFD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8072afcabee5dc1bd4fe739eb431a22de69ab17eede77e3844c84f5b5c14173
#. default-sha256: 50831cd3a7cb3d9664348f7cf8323bf30f5d0551d2f8f4cb1bcdbcfd6aaced48
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EEC57AB7_24CC_4487_88E7_654011AAFDFD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“What are you hoping to get out of repairing my face?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“I’m not trying to "
"‘get’ anything. I just want you to heal up.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“And here I thought you were going to "
"try and make me work at the brothel.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“How many times do I have to tell you? I’m "
"not going to make you be a prostitute.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“What other reason could you have for "
"wanting my face to get better?”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“Because I want to see it. ⟪k:16⟫Isn’t that "
"enough?”⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫“............”⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫“Just so we’re clear, uh, that wasn’t "
"me hitting on you, okay?”⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫“The thought never occurred to me.”⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫"
"⟪k:28⟫“............”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“What are you hoping to get out of repairing my face?”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫“I’m not trying to "
"‘get’ anything. I just want you to heal up.”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫“And here I thought you were going to "
"try and make me work at the brothel.”⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫“How many times do I have to tell you? I’m "
"not going to make you be a prostitute.”⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫“What other reason could you have for "
"wanting my face to get better?”⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫“Because I want to see it. ⟪k:16⟫Isn’t that "
"enough?”⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫“............”⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫“Just so we’re clear, uh, that wasn’t "
"me hitting on you, okay?”⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫“The thought never occurred to me.”⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫"
"⟪k:28⟫“............”"

#: scenario8:scenario8_476B2853_E41B_4320_98A8_488FE11C40C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43e909fc8b66b2f34aff6f4bff51e92b544e09cec0ffc2d817659bcf0d93b1fc
#. default-sha256: 459864a7db52293400dac61b9247c6fe3e59c8eabb5115fa98b11768ceaaa08d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_476B2853_E41B_4320_98A8_488FE11C40C1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She fell quiet, sitting there motionless as I rubbed ointment into her face. ⟪k:1⟫Her skin "
"beneath my thumb was rough and unpleasant to the touch—and, honestly, rather stomach-turning. "
"⟪k:2⟫It was hard to imagine her face would ⟪k:3⟫ever⟪k:4⟫ heal.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫What I’d said "
"about wanting to see her face was true, ⟪k:9⟫but what I wanted more than anything was for her to "
"be able to live a relatively normal life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫She fell quiet, sitting there motionless as I rubbed ointment into her face. ⟪k:1⟫Her skin "
"beneath my thumb was rough and unpleasant to the touch—and, honestly, rather stomach-turning. "
"⟪k:2⟫It was hard to imagine her face would ⟪k:3⟫ever⟪k:4⟫ heal.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫What I’d said "
"about wanting to see her face was true, ⟪k:9⟫but what I wanted more than anything was for her to "
"be able to live a relatively normal life."

#: scenario8:scenario8_18791202_5BCB_4651_855B_39F3CAB6E65F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88a349df56f000574c8ef4f9e7d1bf94e19d6fb4fecacf99bd9b268283482f7e
#. default-sha256: 9f3edbc0f45c1cc34a1057ac75867d8c45620390712ae0c3def9379402fe1e1c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_18791202_5BCB_4651_855B_39F3CAB6E65F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She had no parents. ⟪k:1⟫When I’d asked about her mother, she’d gotten cagey with me, so I "
"assumed she’d been sold off. ⟪k:2⟫When I’d asked about her father, though, she’d just pointed up "
"at the sky, which I took to mean he was dead.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫A young girl, no family, sent off all "
"on her own to some strange land, somewhere along the line ending up in the lord’s cruel grasp. "
"⟪k:6⟫“Misfortune” felt like an understatement, if anything.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫That said, it "
"wasn’t just out of pity that I gave Morgana so much of my attention. ⟪k:11⟫The other reason, "
"though... well, she’d probably go running if I told her. ⟪k:12⟫Hell, ⟪k:13⟫I⟪k:14⟫ wanted to hit "
"myself over the head."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫She had no parents. ⟪k:1⟫When I’d asked about her mother, she’d gotten cagey with me, so I "
"assumed she’d been sold off. ⟪k:2⟫When I’d asked about her father, though, she’d just pointed up "
"at the sky, which I took to mean he was dead.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫A young girl, no family, sent off all "
"on her own to some strange land, somewhere along the line ending up in the lord’s cruel grasp. "
"⟪k:6⟫“Misfortune” felt like an understatement, if anything.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫That said, it "
"wasn’t just out of pity that I gave Morgana so much of my attention. ⟪k:11⟫The other reason, "
"though... well, she’d probably go running if I told her. ⟪k:12⟫Hell, ⟪k:13⟫I⟪k:14⟫ wanted to hit "
"myself over the head."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2DAB02C2_9D17_4903_A9DD_F5DCD3E8E55C
