"though if anyone else were to find out, I could only imagine the looks I would get.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"I mean, Morgana was twelve, and I was twenty-two. ⟪k:10⟫That wasn’t normal.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫(I’ve never felt this way about anyone else that young, either...)"
