"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫As I watched them rejoice, I wondered—⟪k:10⟫was this the future that awaited me?"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Would the people come after me next?⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Was my head going to be "
