#: scenario8:scenario8_A4DB698C_F9FC_4FFE_A03A_DDCCFDA6A76E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2a295caba018ac760dc916614ee5ac51ac0146e8d3be966ac54b6f92c089d8f
