msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A4DB698C_F9FC_4FFE_A03A_DDCCFDA6A76E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Morgana’s words from years back popped into my head.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I believed that—as "
"aggressive, self-centered, and utterly lacking in compassion as my methods may have been—⟪k:4⟫I "
"was following that mantra. ⟪k:5⟫I was offering a helping hand to people who needed it in the only "
"way I knew how.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I wasn’t so dense as to think she would approve of me making an old "
"woman pay the price for my “charity,” though. ⟪k:9⟫Doing this made me no better than a thug.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫But everything has a price. ⟪k:13⟫For every extravagant feast held, a dozen people go "
"the night without food. ⟪k:14⟫That’s simply the way of the world."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Morgana’s words from years back popped into my head.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I believed that—as "
"aggressive, self-centered, and utterly lacking in compassion as my methods may have been—⟪k:4⟫I "
"was following that mantra. ⟪k:5⟫I was offering a helping hand to people who needed it in the only "
"way I knew how.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I wasn’t so dense as to think she would approve of me making an old "
"woman pay the price for my “charity,” though. ⟪k:9⟫Doing this made me no better than a thug.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫But everything has a price. ⟪k:13⟫For every extravagant feast held, a dozen people go "
"the night without food. ⟪k:14⟫That’s simply the way of the world."

#: scenario8:scenario8_61554D03_893A_41EE_8BBA_179B84C6C896
