msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Several days later than originally planned, the swordsman finally arrived at the "
"mansion. ⟪k:3⟫I had chosen the observation tower on the grounds for the witch’s prison, and it "
"was there I waited for him.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫He showed up with a burlap sack swung over his "
"shoulder, setting it down on the ground and saying, “There’s your witch.” ⟪k:7⟫I could only hear "
"muffled grunting from inside the sack, ⟪k:8⟫but it didn’t sound like an old woman inside.⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫The man’s clothes and the bag both reeked of blood."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Several days later than originally planned, the swordsman finally arrived at the "
"mansion. ⟪k:3⟫I had chosen the observation tower on the grounds for the witch’s prison, and it "
"was there I waited for him.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫He showed up with a burlap sack swung over his "
"shoulder, setting it down on the ground and saying, “There’s your witch.” ⟪k:7⟫I could only hear "
"muffled grunting from inside the sack, ⟪k:8⟫but it didn’t sound like an old woman inside.⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫The man’s clothes and the bag both reeked of blood."

